# Q3 2026: marketing wins (for the leadership meeting)

- **MQLs up 76%** quarter on quarter (1,127 in Q2, 1,985 in Q3). Best quarter ever.
- **Leads up 42%** (4,448 to 6,334).
- **Cost per MQL down 43%** ($128 to $73) on flat spend.
- MQL to SQL conversion fell from 43% to 23% (Q3 SQLs / Q3 MQLs): the SDR team cannot keep up with the volume.
- Note: demo requests go straight to SQL; we count them as having reached MQL.
- August leads dipped from July, as usual over the summer.

Ask: approve a fifth SDR from November to work the extra MQLs.
DEVILS_ANALYST_EOF
